{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>This may be the hardest game on Steam. Enter at your own peril!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Orbital Descent, a 3D ball maze challenge where every tilt of the maze can lead you to victory or send you spiraling off track. You're in charge of guiding a rolling ball through twists, turns, and  obstacles as the maze rotates beneath you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can discover hidden shortcuts and speedrun tech to cut your time or find all the coins to go for 100% completion. With simple controls, you can try to master the maze. Use checkpoints to reset to a safe point, but remove the timer, to practice the hardest parts of the level and master the maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So jump in, pick your path, and see if you have what it takes to conquer Orbital Descent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned For the future:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally Generated Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skins</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588530/extras/7d29dc485cf2e30dbb0fe6d9550928c8.avif?t=1767655888\" width=800 height=800 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3588530?t=1767655888","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3588530?t=1767655888","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588530/07ab84b45391dd32100ef0abfd01de1baa560da9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767655888","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588530/07ab84b45391dd32100ef0abfd01de1baa560da9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767655888","categor